{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">東涌昇薈憑藉樓齡新穎、會所設施齊備兼居住環境寧靜舒適，持續備受廣大優質租客青睞。利嘉閣地產東涌-東堤灣畔分行高級聯席董事黃定坤表示，該行團隊精英最新促成東涌昇薈7座中層D室的二手租務成交個案，面積約671呎，採兩房間隔，外望內園景致。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">黃定坤透露，新租客為專才，早前透過利嘉閣真盤源平台獲安排參觀上述放盤。客人參觀單位後，心儀屋苑樓齡新兼配套完善，加上單位景觀理想，兩房開則方正實用，極為符合優質居住需求，睇樓後感到十分滿意，遂決定以月租22,000元承租上址，折合實用面積呎租約32.79元，屬市场合理水平。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">據悉，業主於今年2月以約770萬元購入上述單位，即享約3.42厘租金回報。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T07:38:59.073903+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":293,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}